    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d564">

                <pb facs="0671" n="1505" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v02/pg1505"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 656.119/520</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in the Netherlands</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Garrett</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-06-21T12:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 21, 1918, noon</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1656. Legation’s 3059, June 5, 6 p.m.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d564-f1"/> War Trade
                    Board with approval of Department has determined to enter into definite
                    relations with Netherlands Oversea Trust so that all commodities exported from
                    the United States to Holland, with such exceptions as may be agreed upon, will
                    be consigned to the Netherlands Oversea Trust, which Trust in turn will
                    undertake to give adequate guarantee that commodities so consigned to it will be
                    utilized for purposes intended by the United States in permitting export to
                    Holland. You are authorized to discuss the foregoing informally with the
                    appropriate officials of the Netherlands Oversea Trust, and you will cable your
                    views as to the character and form of undertakings which should be given by the
                    Trust.</p>
                <p>Repeat to London.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
